                                "sense_id": "b2b105d4-3127-3f15-9ce5-07c7424c2b94",
                                "text": "Alle these xv knyghtes were knyghtes of the table round / Soo these with moo other came in to gyders / and bete on bak the kynge of Northumberland and the kynge of Northwalys / whan sir launcelot sawe this as he houed in a lytil leued woode / thenne he sayd vnto syre lauayn / see yonder is a company of good knyghtes"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
